<p>NOTE: As a result of the company's decision to sell certain of its office-based practices and the related write-down, the company discontinued amortizing and depreciating the assets which were written down effective October 31, 1996. If not discontinued, this amortization and depreciation expense would have been approximately $260,000 for November and December of 1996.  This $260,000 has not been deducted in the computation of adjusted net income because this expense will not be incurred in future periods.</p>
